          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 132711,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>title</code> sorgu parametresini parametreli sorguya bağımsız değişken olarak geçir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/songs/search&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"request, response\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" query = db.prepare(\" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM songs WHERE title = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" songs = query.all(request.query.title);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  response.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json(songs);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"157\" endIndex=\"162\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"params\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"body\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>query</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 135965,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İşlemleri kullanarak kitap başlıkları listesini yeni bir tabloya ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Database = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;better-sqlite3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" db = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Database(\" /><text value=\"&quot;library.db&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"db.exec(\" /><text value=\"`CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS books (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  title TEXT UNIQUE\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" insertBook = db.prepare(\" /><text value=\"&quot;INSERT INTO books (title) VALUES (?)&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" booksList = [\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&quot;Moby Dick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&quot;Pride and Prejudice&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&quot;1984&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&quot;The Great Gatsby&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" insertBooksTransaction = db.transaction(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"titles\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" title \" /><text value=\"of\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" titles) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    insertBook.run(title);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  insertBooksTransaction(booksList);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"catch\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (error) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".error(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Transaction failed:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", error.message);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rows = db.prepare(\" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM books&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\").all();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(rows);\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"459\" endIndex=\"469\" /><option startIndex=\"469\" endIndex=\"470\" /><option startIndex=\"470\" endIndex=\"473\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"exec\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"prepare\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { id: 1, title: 'Moby Dick' },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { id: 2, title: 'Pride and Prejudice' },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { id: 3, title: '1984' },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { id: 4, title: 'The Great Gatsby' }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>insertBook</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve son olarak <code>run</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
